Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.25,0:00:38.00,Rin,Rin,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yay! Is everyone having a good time?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:48.75,Luka,Luka,0,0,0,,{\an8}Good. It looks like they're enjoying themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:55.50,KAITO,KAITO,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yeah! But... I've started to want to hear everyone's voices even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:01:01.75,KAITO,KAITO,0,0,0,,{\an8}Next, let's all try doing it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.75,0:01:10.25,Luka,Luka,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, that sounds like fun. Well then, let's all try saying "Yay!" together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.25,0:01:12.75,Luka,Luka,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ready, set...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:17.75,Virtual Singers,Virtual Singers,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Yay!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.00,0:01:27.25,KAITO,KAITO,0,0,0,,{\an8}Thank you! I'm so happy you came to see us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:36.50,Luka,Luka,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's so reassuring to know that everyone here is always watching over those kids with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:42.25,Rin,Rin,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, hey, hey! Since we're here, why don't we all go see how they're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.25,0:01:46.00,Rin,Rin,0,0,0,,{\an8}It sounds like they're doing something interesting today!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.00,0:01:51.75,KAITO,KAITO,0,0,0,,{\an8}That sounds like a good idea. It seems LEN and the others went yesterday, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.75,0:01:55.75,Luka,Luka,0,0,0,,{\an8}Is everyone ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.75,0:01:59.25,KAITO,KAITO,0,0,0,,{\an8}Well then... here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.53,0:02:08.03,An,An,0,0,0,,Phew...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:09.60,An,An,0,0,0,,That was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:11.76,An,An,0,0,0,,Good work, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.28,0:02:16.03,An,An,0,0,0,,That music parade through the city was so much fun, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:16.53,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:22.28,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Thanks to the theme of "delivering gratitude through music," I really felt motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:26.68,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Your group's opening was really great too, Hoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.68,0:02:28.37,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,I could really feel your emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.37,0:02:29.04,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:29.71,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.68,0:02:33.60,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to hear you say that, Kanade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.44,0:02:37.00,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,The confetti fluttering during the chorus was nice, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:40.44,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Who came up with that production?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.44,0:02:42.40,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,That was Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.40,0:02:44.64,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,It sounds like she got the idea from Tsukasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.37,0:02:46.28,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.28,0:02:48.60,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,So that's why Tsukasa-san... Tsukasa-kun, the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:50.24,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,628)}Hehehehe...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.69,0:02:50.24,An,An,0,0,0,,{\pos(200,284)}Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:56.16,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,The other day, he was carrying around the stock of confetti I keep at my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.68,0:02:58.32,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,You're making me blush.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:02.08,An,An,0,0,0,,You seem a bit off, Kamishiro-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:03.36,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Maybe you're just too fired up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.72,0:03:08.28,An,An,0,0,0,,But I didn't know there was such a thing as "stock confetti."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.28,0:03:09.52,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:12.52,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Confetti is essential for a show, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.52,0:03:17.32,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,On the other hand, Shiraishi's group captivated us with just their singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.32,0:03:19.94,An,An,0,0,0,,Well, we do compete with our singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.94,0:03:23.64,An,An,0,0,0,,Akito and the others seemed especially fired up today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:24.88,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.88,0:03:27.00,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,The singing was really electrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.52,0:03:29.68,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,He went home right away today,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:31.98,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,but I wanted to hear a bit more from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.98,0:03:32.87,An,An,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.87,0:03:37.83,An,An,0,0,0,,He said something to Toya about going to a shop nearby that has great cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:42.63,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,But it really was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.63,0:03:46.81,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,The audience all raised their arms at once, it was almost hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.81,0:03:47.51,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.51,0:03:49.74,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Were you okay, Kanade?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.74,0:03:53.73,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,You mentioned before that you aren't very good with crowds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.73,0:03:54.23,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:04:00.53,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,I'm a little... well, a lot tired, but the singing was so good that I didn't mind it that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.53,0:04:01.03,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.68,0:04:02.24,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:03.76,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.56,0:04:08.62,An,An,0,0,0,,But Kamishiro-senpai and his group stole the biggest hype of the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.62,0:04:10.24,An,An,0,0,0,,so I'm a little frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.76,0:04:16.24,An,An,0,0,0,,Just when I thought the silver tape shot out with a bang, you all appeared from the sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:18.36,An,An,0,0,0,,That's just not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.36,0:04:26.07,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Honami told me you'd appear from the sky, but I never expected a magic trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.07,0:04:26.57,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.20,0:04:29.36,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.36,0:04:32.80,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,We didn't actually appear out of thin air, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.32,0:04:38.36,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,We suspended everyone at the top of the float, then lowered down all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:44.80,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,At the same time, we fired metallic tape with gas-powered cannons,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:47.61,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,making it look as if we suddenly dropped out of the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.61,0:04:48.11,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.00,0:04:50.84,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,It really is like magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:53.20,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Though being suspended up there was a bit scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:57.77,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,But seeing the audience's reaction made it all worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.77,0:04:58.27,An,An,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.16,0:05:03.56,An,An,0,0,0,,You look so quiet, Kusanagi, but you've actually got a lot of guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.56,0:05:04.65,An,An,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.65,0:05:05.15,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:07.12,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.12,0:05:09.20,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Ah, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.77,0:05:10.49,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.49,0:05:14.07,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,speaking of which, Hanasato and her group were amazing too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.07,0:05:14.57,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:17.10,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,It's called a call-and-response, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.10,0:05:20.84,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,They really got the crowd pumped up with that. It was so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.84,0:05:21.60,An,An,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:23.00,An,An,0,0,0,,They really were...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:24.72,An,An,0,0,0,,Wait, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.36,0:05:26.56,An,An,0,0,0,,Where did Haruka and the others go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.12,0:05:28.02,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.02,0:05:30.64,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Mizuki disappeared before I even noticed, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.28,0:05:35.40,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Good work, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.40,0:05:36.44,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,I heard Rui flubbed his line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.60,0:05:40.52,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,So this is where you all gathered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:41.88,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,You certainly have sharp ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.68,0:05:45.12,An,An,0,0,0,,Oh, Mizuki, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.12,0:05:46.84,An,An,0,0,0,,And Airi, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.84,0:05:48.25,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,He stumbled quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.25,0:05:48.92,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.92,0:05:49.72,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.44,0:05:51.20,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Kanade.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.20,0:05:55.12,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Oh, we were actually holding a mini handshake event until just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.12,0:05:56.29,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,A mini handshake event?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.29,0:05:56.91,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.91,0:06:00.72,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Momojan asked the staff to set aside a space
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.72,0:06:02.96,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,so they could interact with all their fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:05.73,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,They really know what the fans want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.73,0:06:06.41,An,An,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.41,0:06:08.60,An,An,0,0,0,,Man, I wish I could've gone to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:11.04,An,An,0,0,0,,I wanted to line up for Haruka just to tease her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.12,0:06:14.08,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,I'd love to see how she'd react to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:18.36,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,But this time, Minori was the one who was really popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:19.39,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.39,0:06:19.89,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.52,0:06:21.76,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,It was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.52,0:06:24.04,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,For example...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.65,0:06:33.15,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.68,0:06:34.96,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for your support!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.48,0:06:36.68,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,I'll keep doing my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.24,0:06:42.48,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,I'm so glad more people came to the mini handshake event than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:44.56,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,Next person, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.01,0:06:46.51,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.16,0:06:50.36,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,Are you here supporting us with your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:52.08,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.04,0:06:54.00,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.81,0:06:55.31,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:56.88,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.03,0:06:58.53,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,Three years old?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.53,0:07:00.03,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.59,0:07:01.09,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,You're so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.20,0:07:04.24,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,Well then, let's shake hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.37,0:07:05.87,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:07.84,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,You want to hold hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.95,0:07:09.45,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.04,0:07:11.80,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,Let's hold hands and swing them around!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.21,0:07:13.71,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.28,0:07:15.64,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,Now you want a hug?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.77,0:07:18.47,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.47,0:07:19.38,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.38,0:07:21.04,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,You're a... a little heavy, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:23.68,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,I'm glad it made you happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:26.17,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.21,0:07:28.71,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.56,0:07:34.16,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,All the other little kids waiting in line are asking for hugs now too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:36.72,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,W-what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.48,0:07:40.32,Minori,Minori,0,0,0,,This isn't a handshake event anymore, it's a hugging event!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.16,0:07:53.83,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,And just like that, she was a total hit with the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.83,0:07:54.33,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:56.44,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,That sounds just like Minori.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.72,0:08:01.16,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,That visual is honestly so cute, it makes me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:06.44,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Man, I'm so proud that my Minori is so popular with the little ones too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.44,0:08:07.92,An,An,0,0,0,,You have no right to be proud, Mizuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.96,0:08:10.00,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Mizuki always has a habit of...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.00,0:08:11.00,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,...doing that, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.00,0:08:12.06,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:16.36,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,As a fan, you just want to be able to say, 'I'm the one who raised her!'
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.36,0:08:23.84,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,But seeing that makes me want to be cheered on by little kids and do some fan service too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:24.99,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Wait, you, Mizuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.99,0:08:25.49,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.04,0:08:28.84,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,I mean, given the nature of our group's activities...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.84,0:08:29.40,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Fan service?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.52,0:08:32.52,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Well, our activities...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.52,0:08:33.96,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Did I hear you say fan service?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.52,0:08:35.68,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Ah, well, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:36.64,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.37,0:08:37.80,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Uh oh, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.80,0:08:42.92,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,It's true that I'm curious to see what kind of fan service you would do, Mizuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:50.48,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:55.84,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm a big fan of your videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.79,0:08:57.52,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Like,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.52,0:08:58.80,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,I really love your passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.32,0:09:01.64,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,I really love "Bake no Hana" too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.72,0:09:03.48,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,I mean, "Bake no Hana".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:04.52,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,I really love "Bake no Hana".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.40,0:09:06.39,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,He talks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.39,0:09:07.08,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.08,0:09:09.36,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,I actually love those kinds of troublesome fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.29,0:09:12.79,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.77,0:09:14.27,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:17.04,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Since you started it, I think you should go through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.12,0:09:21.40,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Look, Rui, even Kanade is telling you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.15,0:09:22.84,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.84,0:09:24.36,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Don't I make an adorable child?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.76,0:09:27.49,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,No, not cute at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.49,0:09:28.28,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm simply trying to fulfill
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.28,0:09:29.72,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,a friend's wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.32,0:09:31.20,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,And so,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.60,0:09:33.28,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Mizuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.08,0:09:36.24,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Please shake my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.89,0:09:38.39,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.20,0:09:40.60,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:42.08,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Here, let's shake hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.64,0:09:46.72,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,By the way, I wonder if I can do a cool voice too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.69,0:09:48.19,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,A...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:50.25,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,A cool voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.25,0:09:50.75,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.48,0:09:55.68,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,I'd love to hear Rui's cool voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.01,0:09:57.51,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:00.84,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Let's practice some fan service, Rui.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.19,0:10:02.69,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.72,0:10:04.44,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,I'll give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.89,0:10:06.53,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.53,0:10:07.17,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.68,0:10:11.80,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Are you a fan of mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.89,0:10:14.39,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.40,0:10:17.96,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Which show did you like the best?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.71,0:10:20.21,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Well then,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.08,0:10:22.28,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,you must come see me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.92,0:10:25.84,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,I want to see it, I want to see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.31,0:10:28.81,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.64,0:10:30.84,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Our fan service.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.76,0:10:32.96,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Did it feel... weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.63,0:10:34.13,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.28,0:10:37.32,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Surprisingly,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.20,0:10:40.15,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,it didn't feel weird at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.15,0:10:40.67,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,It didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.67,0:10:41.17,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.28,0:10:48.32,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,I think the weird part was how into it Rui was.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:51.44,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,B-But Mizuki, you were actually pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:53.85,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Honestly, you could become an idol right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.85,0:10:54.35,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.04,0:10:57.24,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Even as a compliment, that's way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.24,0:10:58.92,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,I'm no match for the pros.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:02.48,An,An,0,0,0,,Mizuki really does respect idols, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.36,0:11:06.70,An,An,0,0,0,,Actually, fan service for kids sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.70,0:11:08.48,An,An,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll give it a shot too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.80,0:11:12.52,An,An,0,0,0,,Kusanagi, do you want to do it with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.37,0:11:14.09,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.09,0:11:15.52,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,M-Me too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:16.31,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.31,0:11:17.52,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.52,0:11:19.56,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Nene and An together, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.08,0:11:20.60,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Hey, Rui...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:24.56,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,You're both such great singers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:25.72,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Is it our turn now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:27.52,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,How about something hip-hop?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.28,0:11:29.72,An,An,0,0,0,,Hip-hop?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.65,0:11:31.15,An,An,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.89,0:11:33.39,An,An,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.44,0:11:35.28,An,An,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.28,0:11:35.88,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.24,0:11:38.40,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Would you like a beat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.39,0:11:41.89,An,An,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.52,0:11:43.80,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Um, you can say no, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.52,0:11:46.12,An,An,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.12,0:11:46.64,An,An,0,0,0,,Somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:49.00,An,An,0,0,0,,I feel like I can just ride the momentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.27,0:11:51.77,An,An,0,0,0,,Then,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.38,0:11:52.88,An,An,0,0,0,,here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:54.96,An,An,0,0,0,,Should I go faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:55.63,An,An,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.25,0:11:57.75,An,An,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:03.28,An,An,0,0,0,,Break it down, right in front of you, not just a wall of dreams, a grand ideal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:06.00,An,An,0,0,0,,That's more than enough, now all that's left is to keep moving forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.00,0:12:06.50,An,An,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.33,0:12:07.83,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.19,0:12:09.69,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.04,0:12:13.16,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Hey, I think that's plenty, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.04,0:12:16.60,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,I'd love to hear Nene's too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.24,0:12:21.00,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,I wonder if I can do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.88,0:12:23.48,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Ah, well then,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.60,0:12:26.44,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,I'll give it my best shot, so watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.19,0:12:29.93,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.93,0:12:30.67,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:31.79,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.41,0:12:32.91,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.52,0:12:35.46,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,We are Wandasho.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.46,0:12:36.52,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Forever and ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.60,0:12:41.56,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Smiling, with Rui, samurai spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.56,0:12:43.32,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,High hopes for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:45.24,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Wishes we want to come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:46.92,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Bringing everyone along,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.52,0:12:49.03,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,it's always showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.03,0:12:49.53,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.98,0:12:53.48,An,An,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:54.57,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.57,0:12:55.29,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,I've always...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.88,0:12:58.36,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,listened to Shinonome dropping his vibes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.96,0:13:02.32,An,An,0,0,0,,That explains it! It was so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.95,0:13:03.45,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,This is so embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.48,0:13:05.48,An,An,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:06.16,An,An,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.00,0:13:08.44,An,An,0,0,0,,Alright, now give me a fist bump.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.44,0:13:09.56,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,A... fist bump?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.56,0:13:10.60,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,L-Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.80,0:13:12.48,An,An,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.48,0:13:13.48,An,An,0,0,0,,Let's keep rocking together!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:15.36,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.63,0:13:20.13,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.44,0:13:22.20,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.00,0:13:24.80,An,An,0,0,0,,Kusanagi is really good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.88,0:13:28.23,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,She's got a rapper engraved in her soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.23,0:13:28.99,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,It was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.99,0:13:29.49,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.44,0:13:33.61,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,I should have that same sense of rhythm, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.61,0:13:34.11,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.28,0:13:37.20,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Does that mean you want a turn?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.01,0:13:38.51,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.08,0:13:41.64,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.48,0:13:45.41,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,We're running seriously low on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.41,0:13:46.05,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.05,0:13:46.65,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.65,0:13:47.35,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Alright then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.35,0:13:49.40,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,An, you seemed pretty used to that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.04,0:13:51.26,An,An,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.26,0:13:53.72,An,An,0,0,0,,I talk to the little kids around town quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.28,0:13:55.40,An,An,0,0,0,,So, next up...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.56,0:13:58.01,An,An,0,0,0,,Hoshino, want to give it a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.01,0:13:58.51,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.36,0:14:00.72,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Are we going in order?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.72,0:14:02.76,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,We really don't have to do this just to fill time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:05.16,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,But the script says 'I don't want to, but fine,' so okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.16,0:14:06.12,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,S-So you're doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.12,0:14:06.92,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Alright, nice, nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.68,0:14:09.22,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Let's keep going down the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.22,0:14:11.80,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,I have a recommendation for the kid role from our group.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.80,0:14:12.68,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,It's Kanade!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.13,0:14:14.63,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.48,0:14:16.45,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Good luck, Kanade!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.45,0:14:17.20,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:19.05,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Everyone's counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.05,0:14:19.88,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:20.88,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Are you really sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.48,0:14:23.68,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Um... Big sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.73,0:14:26.23,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.47,0:14:27.97,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Big sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.64,0:14:30.00,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,That's an unexpected side of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.61,0:14:31.11,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.20,0:14:33.80,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Your performance, big sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.48,0:14:35.44,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,it was wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:38.48,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,I was cheering for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.12,0:14:41.76,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.76,0:14:44.12,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're saying such sweet things...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.99,0:14:45.49,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,If you'd like,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:48.72,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,I'd be happy if you listened to it with your friends too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.27,0:14:49.82,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.82,0:14:50.64,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.52,0:14:53.88,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:14:57.44,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,You did great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.36,0:14:59.40,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,That was incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.96,0:15:02.40,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Everyone is exceeding expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.36,0:15:04.58,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,As expected!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.58,0:15:05.84,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,It felt so professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:08.12,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.08,0:15:10.20,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,But then again...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.24,0:15:15.72,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,She didn't sound super childish, but it felt so professional it made my heart race!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:16.84,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,It was wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:17.48,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,It was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.48,0:15:19.04,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,You all did a wonderful job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.87,0:15:20.37,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Now then, finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:24.72,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,as a reward for everyone's hard work,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.68,0:15:28.64,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,I'll deliver some praise-filled fan service!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.24,0:15:31.44,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,Praise-filled fan service?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:32.88,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.88,0:15:34.92,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Sounds like a huge treat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.80,0:15:39.28,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,I mean, everyone was great, so now it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.28,0:15:40.49,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Now, now, now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.49,0:15:41.33,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.33,0:15:42.28,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.28,0:15:44.27,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,since we have this wonderful stage...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.27,0:15:45.20,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.20,0:15:47.80,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,It would be a waste not to use the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.45,0:15:48.95,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:50.68,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Wh-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:51.20,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.20,0:15:53.20,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Please take the microphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:54.00,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.00,0:15:58.20,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm sure the cameraman will follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:01.60,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,I-I don't know what you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.60,0:16:03.24,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,I stood up thinking it was my turn, Rui.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.88,0:16:04.68,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Everyone, stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.25,0:16:06.97,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.97,0:16:07.45,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.45,0:16:07.95,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.60,0:16:11.40,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Since we're here, I'd love to see a sea of pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.15,0:16:12.65,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,W-Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.56,0:16:16.04,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,It's not even my birthday or anything, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.19,0:16:17.69,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.28,0:16:20.52,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Where's the camera? Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:21.11,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,That one?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.12,0:16:22.64,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.64,0:16:29.76,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Everyone, you did a wonderful job singing, dancing, and practicing your fan service today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.44,0:16:36.24,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,For being such good kids, Airi-chan is going to hit you with a Happy Airi Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.92,0:16:40.32,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Please prepare for the wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.48,0:16:43.64,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.64,0:16:45.36,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Mmmmmm, it's charging up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.37,0:16:46.87,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.40,0:16:48.92,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Happy Airi Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.07,0:17:03.57,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.07,0:17:04.57,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:07.00,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,That felt great!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.94,0:17:10.44,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,That was so thrilling...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.44,0:17:10.94,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.72,0:17:12.88,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,H-How was that, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.12,0:17:16.52,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Did it reach all of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.20,0:17:19.63,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Though I feel like I received some incredible fan service at the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.63,0:17:20.13,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Ugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.80,0:17:22.12,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,You'd better remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:23.44,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Though you looked like you wanted to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:26.52,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,Of course it reached everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.76,0:17:29.76,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Then it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.32,0:17:32.32,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Well then, see you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:33.52,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.52,0:17:35.00,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,I'll always be watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:37.52,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Wait, where should I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.88,0:17:41.04,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,A big round of applause!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.91,0:17:42.41,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,That was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.59,0:17:44.09,An,An,0,0,0,,That was the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.68,0:17:46.24,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Don't make me run right before the concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:50.04,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,Being praised that much makes me a little embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.80,0:17:56.56,Airi,Airi,0,0,0,,But I practice my fan service every day for everyone who supports us, so I'm really happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.32,0:17:58.36,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.36,0:18:03.28,Mizuki,Mizuki,0,0,0,,I'll polish my fan service and ad-lib skills too, so I can respond anytime!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.28,0:18:04.72,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Wait, Mizuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.72,0:18:07.00,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Aren't you always good at ad-libbing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.28,0:18:10.92,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,Well, you certainly seem to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.28,0:18:14.20,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,Maybe I should practice a bit too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.84,0:18:18.35,Ichika,Ichika,0,0,0,,It's a great way to say thank you to everyone who supports us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.35,0:18:19.06,An,An,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.06,0:18:23.88,An,An,0,0,0,,We want to make sure our feelings reach everyone, through both words and music.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.88,0:18:29.00,Nene,Nene,0,0,0,,After doing the parade, I want to reach even more people too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:29.76,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.32,0:18:34.20,Rui,Rui,0,0,0,,Let's keep delivering our feelings to as many people as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.00,0:18:54.00,KAITO,KAITO,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hehe. It sounds like it was a very lively parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.00,0:18:59.50,Luka,Luka,0,0,0,,{\an8}That must be why MIKU and the others invited us to hold a parade yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.50,0:19:07.50,Rin,Rin,0,0,0,,{\an8}Let's do our best to deliver tons and tons of gratitude too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.50,0:19:13.00,KAITO,KAITO,0,0,0,,{\an8}Come to think of it, RIN, haven't you already started practicing with LEN?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:18.75,Rin,Rin,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yep! We're going to do a robot dance while singing and playing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.75,0:19:23.50,KAITO,KAITO,0,0,0,,{\an8}W-Will you be okay packing so much into it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.50,0:19:29.00,Luka,Luka,0,0,0,,{\an8}But it sounds like it'll be a really fun and energetic performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.00,0:19:36.75,KAITO,KAITO,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's true. I'll have to do my best too, so I don't lose to RIN and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.75,0:19:43.25,KAITO,KAITO,0,0,0,,{\an8}Well then, everyone. Thank you for coming today!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.25,0:19:50.00,Luka,Luka,0,0,0,,{\an8}We hope you'll continue to receive plenty of our gratitude after this as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:53.00,Rin,Rin,0,0,0,,{\an8}See you! Bye-bye!
